+windows. With zero roots and no hop/lunge/movement window, its active air attack has zero
+vertical movement from an initial rise or fall and across successive spin restarts.
+The hold ends with the combo, native damage/scene interruption, unequip, weapon/map/actor
+change or native command handoff. Existing native fall restoration resumes at the current
+height. This is not a permanent flight mode and grants no invulnerability or ability.
+Ranged regular-Glide floor hover, native spell logic/Final cast visuals, physical-limit
+restrictions, exclusive styles, equipped-weapon duplication and Close ability priority stay.
+
+### Validation and limits
+
+Portable tests exercise body/weapon track independence and idle root removal, finite three
+and extended combos without an enemy or Combo Master, default whiff behavior, air holds
+from rise/fall through the whole chain, and draw-time hand refresh through long body-update
+gaps with rebind/invalid-coordinate rejection. Existing casting, geometry, native ability
