+## Evidence and requested policy
+
+User confirms v32 works. Supplied s371 `kh1-dual-wield(9).log` reports the
+admitted 2257/P_EH000_LAST donor, zero PTYA rows and all 29 loaded motion IDs.
+Source 181 is 264 frames with thirteen weapon-1/group-1 contact windows, the
+last ending at 250. Source 193 is 40 frames with weapon-0/group-3/ATKP-1532
+beginning at 24, no explicit end. Riku item 9 has 64 frames. Current v32 host
+routing is 151/152/182 in both contexts. Confidence: high for these data and
+the user's successful test; the visual name/purpose of 193 is still unknown.
