+  collision group. Require a loaded matching kind-6 shape, valid bone, actual
+  positive STR normal/piercing ATKP and non-RC flag. Missing/nonphysical contact
+  data removes contacts but may still admit its valid animation. This exception
+  does not unlock body/kick contacts on other clips. Native contact finalization
+  and feedback remain; no direct HP writes or synthesized projectile attacks.
+- A committed native Single C Roll starts actual Wisdom Quick Run 203/204 via
+  the existing host movement adapter and loaded growth values. This neither
+  equips Quick Run nor requires Wisdom shots/model scripts or a second blade.
+
+## Poses, casting and effects
+
+Riku's item-use 9 overlays Cure/Gravity/Stop/Aero on ground and in air, as the
+user explicitly reiterated when asked about unmatched effects. It runs on the
+same native cast witness/clock, including interruption and header retirement.
+Fire/Blizzard/Thunder use base Sora casting. Base Sora supplies Guard press,
+ledge hang/climb, normal Glide/Superglide, Roll fallback and missing heavy
+reactions. Native movement, ability gates and spell rules still execute.
+Riku movement, ordinary item/damage and scene idle remain on his own tracks.
+
+Riku's admitted body map cannot read Sora/Wisdom's indexed skeleton. Keep it
+for Riku actions and build a separate canonical Sora retarget for base fallback
+poses and the owned Wisdom dodge. Ledge targets are still aligned to the native
+hands. Do not change the confirmed dual-blade Glide attachment/color renderer.
