+finite termination without resampling or loss of any contact. Existing cast,
+defense, Glide, Fire, Quick Run and ability tests remain. All 507 tests in 31 suites pass (160 style tests). Windows x64 release build
+uses RUSTFLAGS=-C codegen-units=1, also used for portable tests; this avoids
